{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2019-09-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR OF 2019', 'text': 'MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR OF 2019. FOR THE PERIOD, THE COMPANY EXPECTS TO GROW SALES COMPARED TO 2018 BY 1% TO 2%, WHICH IN CONSTANT CURRENCY IS A 3% TO 4% PROJECTED GROWTH RATE. OPERATING INCOME IN 2019 IS EXPECTED TO GROW 8% TO 9% FROM $891 MILLION OF OPERATING INCOME IN 2018. MCCORMICK INCREASED ITS PROJECTED 2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE TO BE IN THE RANGE OF $5.20 TO $5.25 COMPARED TO $7.00 OF EARNINGS PER SHARE IN 2018.'}